CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790767134
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARegulating AI 'not the right place to
OL,4,Astart' says Bailey
OL,5,
OL,6,FBailey said the development of AI
OL,7,Fshould not be halted or prohibited -
OL,8,F"on the contrary, the benefits are
OL,9,Fimmense" - but added there must be a
OL,10,Fsystem for intervention and to
OL,11,Festablish boundaries in which AI
OL,12,Foperates.
OL,14,FIn recent weeks, the debate about the
OL,15,Fpotential risks surrounding the rapid
OL,16,Fdevelopment of AI and what it means for
OL,17,Fhumanity has intensified.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
